Let $d=d^v_m:v_{\mathrm{proet}}^*L_X^{\mathrm{pro}}\xrightarrow{\sim}L_{X'}^{\mathrm{pro}}$ be the pullback of [lem-amb-finite-root-site-comparison], induced by pullback of roots, so $d$ sends the pullback of a local $z\otimes a$ to $v^\sharp(z)\otimes a$. The composites $
